#. module: om_ai
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_ai
msgid ""
"\n"
"One AI engine for Odoo: connect your own AI provider with your own key, or run a local model.\n"
"Providers and models with prices, defaults per purpose, a Python API with tool calling and\n"
"JSON output, a usage log with cost estimates and daily limits, prompt templates, an AI chat in\n"
"Discuss that looks up records you can see, and the editor text generation through your provider.\n"
msgstr ""

